			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1923350">
									

<p>It's meant to stand out like a sore thumb. The Esoteric Warfare Unit is downright tiny (fifty people, total), permanently underfunded, generally disliked and feared by the rest of the Foundation. Half the reason it exists are policy loopholes and the fact that it's a certain O5's pet project. There's a reason they go on so many extra-universal ops through Multi-U: the Overseers generally don't like them poking around in the Baseline.</p>
<p>You will notice that this is easily transferable to the out-of-universe Foundation. Art imitates life.</p>

